Synthetic controls invoke the shipping scanner over a complete fixture and over each
malformed shape; refusal output is captured and matched below.

a complete fixture with an extra existing path and no Git metadata passes: true
a concatenated append is refused in both directions, naming the nonexistent entry and omitted golden: true
a missing trailing newline is refused with its append-corruption diagnostic: true
a blank line is refused as a line containing no path: true
an undeclared file present in the build root is refused as a stale artifact: true

